findings.fix:
Change the import to omit the file extension so Vite can resolve the module correctly:
```tsx
- import App from './App.tsx';
+ import App from './App';
```

Add a runtime guard and throw a clear error if the root element is not found:
```tsx
const rootElement = document.getElementById('root');
if (!rootElement) {
  throw new Error('Root element not found');
}
createRoot(rootElement).render(
  <StrictMode>
    <App />
  </StrictMode>
);
```
